#### `harry-candidate-a`
```text
Master sprite sheet of Harry Potter as described in the original books (not the films), presented in a 3x2 grid of 6 sprite poses, matching the retro pixel art style, proportions, and top-left lighting of the reference sprites v3-dobby.png and v3-winky.png.

Character design: Harry Potter (book HP1-HP3) drawn as a charming, cute chibi sprite (large head roughly 40% of total height, slender body, knobbly knees). He has untidy jet-black hair sticking up wildly at the back, perfectly round black glasses frames, bright vivid green eyes with white highlight dots, a small thin scarlet-red lightning bolt scar visible on his forehead, and a warm friendly smile. He is dressed in winter clothes: Mrs Weasley's hand-knitted emerald-green wool sweater (plain chunky knit, no initial), a warm scarlet-and-gold striped Gryffindor scarf wrapped around his neck, dark charcoal trousers, and dark brown leather boots. Stylized chibi book appearance, strictly not resembling any film actor or film costumes.

Sprite Sheet Layout: Exactly 6 sprites arranged in a clean 3x2 grid (3 columns, 2 rows) on a pure white background. Each sprite is shown in three-quarter view facing towards the lower-left, with feet aligned along a consistent horizontal baseline in each row:
- Row 1, Column 1 (idle): Harry Potter standing in a relaxed pose, smiling cheerfully and waving one hand in greeting.
- Row 1, Column 2 (walk-1): Harry Potter walking, left leg stepping visibly forward, arms swinging in stride.
- Row 1, Column 3 (walk-2): Harry Potter walking, right leg stepping visibly forward, matching head height with walk-1.
- Row 2, Column 1 (fly-throw): Harry Potter flying sitting on his Nimbus Two Thousand broomstick (dark polished wood handle roughly horizontal, bundle of twigs on the right), leaning forward and [drawing] his arm back ready to throw the bright scarlet-red Quaffle ball.
- Row 2, Column 2 (fly-catch): Harry Potter flying on the Nimbus Two Thousand broomstick in the same flight position, extending both hands forward to catch the scarlet-red Quaffle.
- Row 2, Column 3 (snowball): Harry Potter standing on the ground, leaning into a dynamic overhand throw of a pale snow-colored snowball, his scarlet-and-gold scarf trailing behind him.

Style and Technical Specs: Crisp retro 2D pixel art on a uniform chunky block grid, solid pixel clusters, dark outline (#231F2E), crisp lighting from the top-left, strictly flat colors using the 24-color sprite palette (emerald greens #24483F/#3F6A45/#71934B, scarlets #874056/#C75B4B, golds #FFC36B/#ED8A45, darks #231F2E/#41465C, warm skin tones #F5D69A/#E7AE73). No blur, no gradients, no anti-aliasing, no drop shadows, no text labels, no dividing lines, no UI elements.
```

